helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085	76			0	it	Fate clic su \<emph\>Inserisci\</emph\> e quindi su \<emph\>Chiudi\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
