helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733	23			0	it	Selezionate \<emph\>Conta le righe di questo paragrafo\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153758	24			0	it	Fate clic su \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
