helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147553	246			0	it	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ARABO("MMII")\</item\> restituisce 2002				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id8796349				0	it	\<bookmark_value\>Funzione ASC\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
