helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\flat_icons.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	5			0	it	Scegliete \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferenze\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Strumenti - Opzioni\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename]\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
