helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2004				0	it	Il pannello \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Stili e formattazione\</item\> contiene la finestra \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Stili e formattazione\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Stili e formattazione\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Stili e formattazione\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Stili e formattazione\</link\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20130618 17:22:18
